(7289001, 1136365, 60173, '<td valign="top">I really like this image, and for that reason I can see some things I might have done differently. <br/> <br/>I think the burning of the clouds is a touch overdone.<br/> <br/>The reds might have been pushed a weeeee bit too much, but I appreciate where you went with it.<br/> <br/>I would have cropped off the grassy bit at the bottom. It''s just a philosophy of mine, I guess. If you crop that out, the viewer doesn''t feel like they''re standing on a ledge. That means the sea ends. When the viewer doesn''t know where it ends, they''re left wondering, "Where does it end?" Does that make sense?</td>', 'I really like this image, and for that reason I can see some things I might have done differently.  I think the burning of the clouds is a touch overdone. The reds might have been pushed a weeeee bit too much, but I appreciate where you went with it. I would have cropped off the grassy bit at the bottom. It''s just a philosophy of mine, I guess. If you crop that out, the viewer doesn''t feel like they''re standing on a ledge. That means the sea ends. When the viewer doesn''t know where it ends, they''re left wondering, "Where does it end?" Does that make sense?', '2014-12-02 00:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7289002, 1136461, 60173, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo of a kitty. Everything works so well together.</td>', 'Beautiful photo of a kitty. Everything works so well together.', '2014-12-02 00:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7289004, 1135594, 30982, '<td valign="top">Such perfectly spaced trees!</td>', 'Such perfectly spaced trees!', '2014-12-02 00:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
