(7289075, 1136348, 121111, '<td valign="top">I really like how you managed to capture the concentration of the person , even by showing just a small portion of the face, surrounded by the small figures, very nice moody light and great sense of the context where this took place</td>', 'I really like how you managed to capture the concentration of the person , even by showing just a small portion of the face, surrounded by the small figures, very nice moody light and great sense of the context where this took place', '2014-12-02 10:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
