(7289106, 1136372, 16148, '<td valign="top">I''m not usually drawn to images of birds.  We see so many.  Your choice of DOF and the wire fence really pull me in.  The center composition seems a natural fit too.  All in all, a terrific nature photograph.</td>', 'I''m not usually drawn to images of birds.  We see so many.  Your choice of DOF and the wire fence really pull me in.  The center composition seems a natural fit too.  All in all, a terrific nature photograph.', '2014-12-02 11:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7289110, 1135143, 16148, '<td valign="top">Lovely bleached analog look to this.  The heavy vignette isolates your main subject and helps simplify this complex scene.  Your composition, with leading lines from the bent legs, pulls us in.  Terrific catch!  Be careful out there.</td>', 'Lovely bleached analog look to this.  The heavy vignette isolates your main subject and helps simplify this complex scene.  Your composition, with leading lines from the bent legs, pulls us in.  Terrific catch!  Be careful out there.', '2014-12-02 12:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
