(7290505, 1136329, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed, excellent time of day to shoot this scene and I like the inclusion of the ''ghostly'' people. In the sky there is what looks like water spots on the filter or the lens, though - understandable if it was raining, but if not it might be time to clean those. One of my least favorite parts of shooting in the rain or shooting water spray.</td>', 'Nicely composed, excellent time of day to shoot this scene and I like the inclusion of the ''ghostly'' people. In the sky there is what looks like water spots on the filter or the lens, though - understandable if it was raining, but if not it might be time to clean those. One of my least favorite parts of shooting in the rain or shooting water spray.', '2014-12-07 00:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7290506, 1136453, 13077, '<td valign="top">Cute kitties and a nice colorful scene.</td>', 'Cute kitties and a nice colorful scene.', '2014-12-07 00:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
