(7290726, 1136220, 59029, '<td valign="top">Wendy. This image is getting a 1 from me, and here''s why: you posted it on Facebook last week, prior to FS voting starting. <br/> <br/>I am on FB maybe once a month and this pic was there along with three others from the same session.  You have a whole ton of DPC friends on FB, as do I.  But I don''t go posting potential entries before entering them.<br/> <br/>So even if you aren''t breaking any *official* DPC rules, you sure are violating MY sense of fair play and level playing field.<br/> <br/>Feel free to PM me if you like, but the 1 stays.<br/> <br/>Susan</td>', 'Wendy. This image is getting a 1 from me, and here''s why: you posted it on Facebook last week, prior to FS voting starting.  I am on FB maybe once a month and this pic was there along with three others from the same session.  You have a whole ton of DPC friends on FB, as do I.  But I don''t go posting potential entries before entering them. So even if you aren''t breaking any *official* DPC rules, you sure are violating MY sense of fair play and level playing field. Feel free to PM me if you like, but the 1 stays. Susan', '2014-12-07 17:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
