(7291159, 1136203, 101668, '<td valign="top">yes absolutely divine light and stance and clarity and everything. So very beautiful no matter how you got the shot. And a wonderful score for fourth. In any other challenge this would''ve ribboned. Did I mention the pp, that too is wonderful. Congrats on the HM</td>', 'yes absolutely divine light and stance and clarity and everything. So very beautiful no matter how you got the shot. And a wonderful score for fourth. In any other challenge this would''ve ribboned. Did I mention the pp, that too is wonderful. Congrats on the HM', '2014-12-08 05:31:21.000000', NULL, 0),
