(7291542, 1136407, 113156, '<td valign="top">Should have voted, would have been a 9 or 10 from me, transport and modernity, a fast but slow world.</td>', 'Should have voted, would have been a 9 or 10 from me, transport and modernity, a fast but slow world.', '2014-12-09 06:19:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(7291570, 1136203, 124982, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by hahn23:</b></div><hr/><i> Bird in captivity.  How hard is it to poke a camera lens into the face of a zoo bird? </i></td></tr></table> <br/>About as hard as it is for you to poke a camera at trees and mountains and shoehorn them into every challenge as you normally do, I''m guessing.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2014-12-09 13:52:18.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by hahn23: Bird in captivity.  How hard is it to poke a camera lens into the face of a zoo bird?  About as hard as it is for you to poke a camera at trees and mountains and shoehorn them into every challenge as you normally do, I''m guessing.', '2014-12-09 10:06:23.000000', '2014-12-09 13:52:18.000000', 0),
