(7291757, 1136323, 6519, '<td valign="top">Oh my..... that wreath is lovely!!!! I know a couple of horse crazy people who would ADORE this. Well done, Julie!<br/> <br/>It reminds me of the good old days when I was into crafts, too, and one the things I made were these lovely Christmas decorations - <a href="https://www.google.de/search?q=strohsterne+basteln&amp;sa=X&amp;biw=1369&amp;bih=926&amp;tbm=isch&amp;tbo=u&amp;source=univ&amp;ei=gcmHVJaREtD88QWqh4KoDw&amp;ved=0CCUQsAQ" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">stars made from straw.</a></td>', 'Oh my..... that wreath is lovely!!!! I know a couple of horse crazy people who would ADORE this. Well done, Julie! It reminds me of the good old days when I was into crafts, too, and one the things I made were these lovely Christmas decorations - stars made from straw.', '2014-12-09 23:35:12.000000', NULL, 0),
